From: codeandsolder <codeandsolder@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath12k: add explicit IPQ5332 UMACNOC QDSS diagnostics

Use the firmware's existing WLFW QDSS protocol to trace the exact
NoC fabric reporting the intermittent root-Q6 UserPD1 fatal.

Keep QDSS entirely opt-in through debugfs. Bound the ETR buffer to
a dedicated named reserved-memory range, validate the firmware memory
request and save indications, and forward raw traces as devcoredumps.
Retain the existing host capability negotiation and normal boot path.

Wire-format definitions adapted from Qualcomm QSDK's 2025 QDSS patch.
Source: Telecominfraproject/wlan-ap patch 0527-001.

Signed-off-by: codeandsolder <codeandsolder@gmail.com>
---
